{"command":"order hold 30456 "Weight check rejected: packed labelled items measured about 1097 g versus 1372 +/-15 g; swapping honey jars did not resolve. During investigation, coffee pickup apparently displaced carton; subsequent placement triggered 70 N protective stop. Motion stopped; operator inspection required before recovery or shipping."; robot status; cat >> ~/LOGBOOK.md <<'EOF'

PK-3 afternoon — Order 30456 HELD, not released. Initial labelled CBN-500 it01, HON-450 it03 and SPI-050 it05 packed: gross 1097 g, expected 1372 +/-15 g, REJECT. Substituting HON-450 it04 also gave 1096–1097 g, REJECT. Removing either honey jar reduced reading to about 787 g (apparent honey gross about 310 g versus catalogue 585 g); cause unconfirmed. Honey jars it03 and it04 left on bench slots 1 and 2. During further investigation, picking it01 unexpectedly reduced platform reading to about zero; carton camera subsequently showed platform empty. Attempted placement to bin-CBN-500 triggered protective stop at 70 N on it01_g and released object where it was. No further motion commanded. Operator must inspect carton/item location, protective-stop cause and honey batch L2611 / weight discrepancy before recovery. No check settings changed and no release performed.
EOF"}
